      "description": "Checks dismissal flag $FF19A7 (-> 0x01231C), dispatches $FF19A2 command (1->0x011D8A, 2->0x011BCC, 3->0x011FA6), evaluates auto-rescue heal (+$AA cooldown $1E, $FF0DB6 >= 3, +$8A(a5) < +$88(a5)>>3, 20 SP via 0x011B28 -> 0x011BE0), tracks elevation (0x0123B4), and runs either idle circular orbit (+$A0=120, +$A1=40 delay, +$9E angle +/-6 by +$9F bit 1 via $05D706 with cos>>2 X and isometric (sin>>3)+(sin>>4) Y) or 18px ($12) 4-way behind-Ali follow via 0x00E45E (d4==0 arms orbit, 1<=d4<=2 halves vel and copies Ali facing, d4>2 full follow +$2A=2)."
